# leap LineageOS kernel config fragment (merged last, after Motorola's moto-sun-leap.config).
# CONFIG_DRM_DYNAMIC_REFRESH_RATE (drivers/soc/qcom/Kconfig, Motorola-only) has no in-kernel user. It is passed
# to the module builds instead (BoardConfigKernelSource.mk).
# CONFIG_DRM_DYNAMIC_REFRESH_RATE is not set
# Motorola's config also enables the sibling SoCs, whose techpack device trees reference bindings this
# kernel does not have. leap is sun only.
# CONFIG_ARCH_KERA is not set
# CONFIG_ARCH_TUNA is not set
